      ],
      "definitions": {"zh-CN": "计算思维是把问题转化为可由人或机器执行的步骤的思考方式，包含抽象、分解、模式识别与算法设计。", "en": "Computational thinking turns a problem into steps a human or machine can execute, using abstraction, decomposition, pattern recognition, and algorithm design."},
