      "definitions": {"zh-CN": "规格用输入、输出、约束和成功标准精确描述一段程序“应该做什么”，是判断对错的前提。", "en": "A specification precisely states a program's inputs, outputs, constraints, and success criteria; it is the basis for judging correctness."},
