      ],
      "definitions": {"zh-CN": "伪代码用接近自然语言的分步描述表达算法，不要求符合具体语言语法，但必须无歧义。", "en": "Pseudocode expresses an algorithm in near-natural-language steps; it need not follow real syntax but must be unambiguous."},
